    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d111-a1">

                <pb facs="0142" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg68"/>

                <head>Viscount Monck to Mr. Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Quebec,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-31"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 31, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>S<hi rendition="#small-caps">ir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your despatch of January 25, enclosing a note from the Secretary of State of
                    the United States, respecting the designs of the enemies of the United States
                    lurking in Canada of making a formidable incursion on the town of Burlington,
                    Vermont, and Whitehall, New York.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to request you to convey to Mr. Seward my assurance that the
                    government of Canada will use every exertion to detect and defeat such
                    plans.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MONCK.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burnley,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
